#ROOM
Vnum     200
Name     A Small Shuttle~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     You stand inside a small shuttlecraft that flies between Coruscant's
Menari Spaceport and An Orbitting Shipyard. There are several plastic
covered seats along the walls but passengers are mostly expected to
stand for the brief journey.
Type LEAVE to exit after the ship lands.
~
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     201
Name     Serin Pluogus Tourbus Platform~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     This platform is reserved for the publicly funded tour shuttle, the
Serin Pluogus. The rest of the Menari spaceport is to the west and
north of here.  Around the rest of the platform you can view the
southern reaches of Imperial  City ( a rather inapropriate name as
Coruscant has been the governing seat  of the New Republic for over
20 years ). To the south tower the Menari Mountains.
When the pluogus lands type BOARD PLUOGUS to enter.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    204
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 209 1 201
Reset O 0 203 1 201
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     202
Name     Shuttle Platform~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     This platform is reserved for shuttles flying between Menari spaceport
and orbitting space stations. The rest of the Menari spaceport is to
the south-east and  north of here.  Around the rest of the platform
you can view the southern reaches of Imperial  City ( a rather
inapropriate name as Coruscant has been the governing seat  of the
New Republic for over 20 years ). To the south tower the Menari
Mountains.
 
Wait here for the shipyard ferry. When it lands BOARD FERRY.
 
~
#EXIT
