#ROOM
Vnum     203
Name     Main Platform~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     This is the main platform in the Menari Spaceport. All kinds of ships
are docked here. There are even a few that can be rented. The rest of
the spaceport is to the north. Around it is the southern end of
Imperial City ( or Government City ) which covers a good portion of
the planet. To the south is a beautiful view of the Menari Mountain
Range. 
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    204
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 206 2 203
Reset M 0 206 2 203
